  "procedure": [
    "tools/rogues-sharpness-probe/run.py builds a fresh server under build/rogues-sharpness-probe/<label>/ with Rogues, Apothic Enchanting and the dependency closure of both from the deployed server's mods directory",
    "a probe mod reads the Sharpness registry entry on SERVER_STARTED and re-encodes it with Enchantment.DIRECT_CODEC",
    "flat bonus = the DAMAGE effects processed from 0 at each level; compatibility from Enchantment.areCompatible",
    "resource bytes are read through ResourceManager getResource/listResources/getResourceStack and through the rogues PackResources getResource/listResources",
    "version-mismatch rewrites only the version in the fixture copy of Rogues' fabric.mod.json"
  ],
